        "content_text": "Harp therapist serenades lemurs, rhinos and fish at Canberra's National Zoo and Aquarium.\n\nThese lemurs like to move it, move it to the sound of a harp.\n\n<a href=\"https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-07-18/harp-therapist-plays-for-animals-at-canberra-zoo/106887378\">Harp therapist Alison Ware provides musical enrichment for animals at Canberra's National Zoo and Aquarium, adapting what she plays to suit different species.</a>",
