        "title": "\"The new collection spans a narrow 12-year window from 1947-1959\"",
        "url": "https://www.metafilter.com/213937/The-new-collection-spans-a-narrow-12-year-window-from-1947-1959",
        "content_text": "Eric Falquero (<em>The 51st</em>, 07/16/2026), \"<a href='https://51st.news/dc-old-photos-mid-century-archives/'>Check out thousands of photos of midcentury D.C.</a>\": Via \"The Office of Public Records and Archives ... This is its largest <a href='https://archives.dc.gov/collections/photograph-collections?ref=51st.news'>digital photo collection to date</a>.\" The watermarked images are often ceremonial, not candid like <a href='https://www.metafilter.com/211665/This-was-Paris-in-1970'>Paris in the 70s</a>, but see photos of <a href='https://archives.dc.gov/Documents/Detail/christmas-safety-float-2/1979944'>Santa Claus's safety message</a> (<a href='https://archives.dc.gov/documents?search=\"\"christmas\"\"safety\"\"&searchtypes=Metadata|Full%20text&applyState=true'>series</a>), <a href='https://archives.dc.gov/Documents/Detail/adams-morgan-project-43/1979381'>street views</a> and <a href='https://archives.dc.gov/Documents/Detail/adams-morgan-project-47/1979389'>idealized</a> <a href='https://archives.dc.gov/Documents/Detail/adams-morgan-project-59/1979401'>interiors</a> in an <a href='https://archives.dc.gov/documents?search=\"\"adams%20morgan%20project\"\"&searchtypes=Metadata|Full%20text&applyState=true'>Adams Morgan Project series</a>, <a href='https://archives.dc.gov/Documents/Detail/alley-pictures-8th-9th-streets-nw-10/1977241'>Alley Pictures</a> (<a href='https://archives.dc.gov/documents?search=\"\"alley%20pictures\"\"&searchtypes=Metadata|Full%20text&applyState=true'>series</a>), <a href='https://archives.dc.gov/Documents/Detail/horse-troughs-14/1977385'>Horse Troughs</a> (<a href='https://archives.dc.gov/documents?search=\"\"troughs\"\"&searchtypes=Metadata|Full%20text&applyState=true'>series</a>), <a href='https://archives.dc.gov/Documents/Detail/polio-shots-and-open-air-movies-at-greenleaf-gardens-2/1979427'>Polio Shots and Open Air Movies</a> (<a href='https://archives.dc.gov/documents?search=\"\"polio%20shots\"\"&searchtypes=Metadata|Full%20text&applyState=true'>series</a>), <a href='https://archives.dc.gov/Documents/Detail/jayne-mansfield-receives-key-to-the-city-5/1977174'>Jayne Mansfield</a> (<a href='https://archives.dc.gov/documents?search=\"\"jayne%20mansfield\"\"&searchtypes=Metadata|Full%20text&applyState=true'>series</a>), <a href='https://archives.dc.gov/Documents/Detail/dilapidated-housing-at-5th-st.-s.e.-3/1977482'>Dilapidated Housing</a> (<a href='https://archives.dc.gov/documents?search=\"\"dilapidated%20housing\"\"&searchtypes=Metadata|Full%20text&applyState=true'>series</a>), <a href='https://archives.dc.gov/Documents/Detail/d.c.-general-hospital-7/1977519'>D.C. General</a> (<a href='https://archives.dc.gov/documents?search=\"\"d.c.%20general\"\"&searchtypes=Metadata|Full%20text&applyState=true'>series</a>, not to mention the <a href='https://archives.dc.gov/Documents/Detail/chest-x-ray-1/1977531'>X-Ray Truck</a> and its <a href='https://archives.dc.gov/documents?search=\"\"x-ray%20truck\"\"&searchtypes=Metadata|Full%20text&applyState=true'>series</a>), <a href='https://archives.dc.gov/Documents/Detail/florida-avenue-market-1959-44/1979692'>Florida Avenue Market</a> (<a href='https://archives.dc.gov/documents?search=\"\"florida%20avenue%20market\"\"&searchtypes=Metadata|Full%20text&applyState=true'>series</a>), <a href='https://archives.dc.gov/Documents/Detail/fourth-of-july-celebrations-july-1957-10/1978422'>Fourth of July fireworks</a> (<a href='https://archives.dc.gov/documents?search=\"\"fourth%20of%20july\"\"&searchtypes=Metadata|Full%20text&applyState=true'>series</a>), <a href='https://archives.dc.gov/Documents/Detail/ewells-barbershop-february-1957-7/1978109'>Ewells Barbershop</a> (<a href='https://archives.dc.gov/documents?search=\"\"ewells%20barbershop\"\"&searchtypes=Metadata|Full%20text&applyState=true'>series</a>), <a href='https://archives.dc.gov/Documents/Detail/public-health-photographs-of-neighborhoods-21/1977423'>Public Health Photos of Neighborhoods</a> (<a href='https://archives.dc.gov/documents?search=\"\"public%20health%20photographs%20of%20neighborhoods\"\"&searchtypes=Metadata|Full%20text&applyState=true'>series</a>), <a href='https://archives.dc.gov/Documents/Detail/healthy-food-presentation-1/1978673'>The Wheel of Good Eating</a> (<a href='https://archives.dc.gov/documents?search=\"\"healthy%20food%20presentation\"\"&searchtypes=Metadata|Full%20text&applyState=true'>series</a>), and a railroad <a href='https://archives.dc.gov/Documents/Detail/drinking-water-station-at-railroad-station-10/1978458'>Drinking Water Station</a> (<a href='https://archives.dc.gov/documents?search=\"\"drinking%20water%20station\"\"&searchtypes=Metadata|Full%20text&applyState=true'>series</a>). An <a href='https://archives.dc.gov/collections/photograph-collections'>earlier collection</a> documented <a href='https://archives.dc.gov/collections/photograph-collections/engineering-department-images-documenting-illegal-parking'>illegal parking</a>.",
        "type": "Internet",
