        "title": "Language is magic. It is invocation and conjuration.",
        "url": "https://www.metafilter.com/213935/Language-is-magic-It-is-invocation-and-conjuration",
        "content_text": "This is the peculiar genius of the English language: this clash and chaos of radically different tones and textures, and this <a href=\"https://thelampmagazine.com/blog/how-to-write-english-prose\">inexhaustible store</a> of ever more exotic words, with all their ever finer distinctions of association and connotation.",
