        "content_text": "<a href=\"https://youtu.be/g79GPZSQHBk?si=KC-EWqbeikfPBovM\">A Neuromancer trailer appears</a> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neuromancer_(TV_series)\">The tv adaptation</a> is due to launch in January.",
